<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Cody Fry</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Things You Said"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Things You Said (feat. Abby Cates)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Abby Cates"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Cody Fry"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Chad Copelin"/><amll:meta key="album" value="The End"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Things You Said"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2065868022"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="436716255"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="2k8ZdI4C1ox7duEFJN7BgD"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1692622465"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUM72307288"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="96868062"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Shomi-FJS"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:51.289"><div begin="00:17.049" end="03:51.289"><p begin="00:17.049" end="00:20.186" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:17.049" end="00:17.240">I</span> <span begin="00:17.240" end="00:17.494">was</span> <span begin="00:17.494" end="00:17.971">walking</span> <span begin="00:17.971" end="00:18.246">in</span> <span begin="00:18.246" end="00:18.482">the</span> <span begin="00:18.482" end="00:18.943">woods</span> <span begin="00:18.943" end="00:19.278">one</span> <span begin="00:19.401" end="00:20.186">day</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">某日，我独自漫步于密林深处</span></p><p begin="00:21.123" end="00:23.875" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:21.123" end="00:21.470">Trying</span> <span begin="00:21.470" end="00:21.575">to</span> <span begin="00:21.631" end="00:21.879">keep</span> <span begin="00:21.879" end="00:22.123">the</span> <span begin="00:22.123" end="00:22.652">ghosts</span> <span begin="00:22.652" end="00:22.954">at</span> <span begin="00:23.099" end="00:23.875">bay</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">试图将过往的幽影抵挡在外</span></p><p begin="00:24.858" end="00:31.287" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:24.858" end="00:25.177">Then</span> <span begin="00:25.177" end="00:25.269">I</span> <span begin="00:25.269" end="00:25.634">thought</span> <span begin="00:25.634" end="00:25.766">I</span> <span begin="00:25.766" end="00:26.245">saw</span> <span begin="00:26.245" end="00:26.584">your</span> <span begin="00:26.584" end="00:27.158">face</span> <span begin="00:27.158" end="00:27.321">but</span> <span begin="00:27.321" end="00:27.552">it</span> <span begin="00:27.552" end="00:28.331">was</span> <span begin="00:28.617" end="00:29.513">just</span> <span begin="00:29.513" end="00:31.287">leaves</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">恍惚间惊见你的容颜，却不过是枝叶摇晃</span></p><p begin="00:32.035" end="00:35.075" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:32.035" end="00:32.217">I</span> <span begin="00:32.217" end="00:32.577">see</span> <span begin="00:32.577" end="00:32.809">you</span> <span begin="00:32.809" end="00:32.974">in</span> <span begin="00:32.974" end="00:33.094">the</span> <span begin="00:33.094" end="00:34.105">strangest</span> <span begin="00:34.105" end="00:35.075">things</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我总在不可思议的事物望见你</span></p><p begin="00:35.708" end="00:38.943" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:35.708" end="00:36.006">Your</span> <span begin="00:36.006" end="00:36.329">voice</span> <span begin="00:36.329" end="00:36.498">in</span> <span begin="00:36.498" end="00:36.781">every</span> <span begin="00:36.934" end="00:37.313">bird</span> <span begin="00:37.402" end="00:37.685">that</span> <span begin="00:37.685" end="00:38.943">sings</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">每一声鸟鸣里，都仿佛藏着你的回响</span></p><p begin="00:39.677" end="00:46.165" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:39.677" end="00:39.944">Can</span> <span begin="00:39.944" end="00:40.143">they</span> <span begin="00:40.143" end="00:40.517">hear</span> <span begin="00:40.517" end="00:40.964">it</span> <span begin="00:41.020" end="00:41.869">echoing</span> <span begin="00:41.869" end="00:42.164">or</span> <span begin="00:42.164" end="00:42.288">is</span> <span begin="00:42.288" end="00:42.679">that</span> <span begin="00:43.380" end="00:44.288">just</span> <span begin="00:44.288" end="00:46.165">me?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">世间万物皆闻此回响，亦或仅是我的一厢情愿？</span></p><p begin="00:48.001" end="00:53.472" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:48.001" end="00:48.271">I</span> <span begin="00:48.271" end="00:48.487">don't</span> <span begin="00:48.487" end="00:49.161">believe</span> <span begin="00:49.161" end="00:49.536">in</span> <span begin="00:49.536" end="00:51.506">haunted</span> <span begin="00:51.506" end="00:53.472">houses</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我从不相信世上真有鬼屋</span></p><p begin="00:54.947" end="00:58.176" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:54.947" end="00:55.171">But</span> <span begin="00:55.171" end="00:55.283">I</span> <span begin="00:55.283" end="00:55.719">still</span> <span begin="00:55.719" end="00:56.066">see</span> <span begin="00:56.066" end="00:56.276">you</span> <span begin="00:56.276" end="00:56.635">there</span> <span begin="00:56.635" end="00:56.818">on</span> <span begin="00:56.818" end="00:56.935">the</span> <span begin="00:57.004" end="00:58.176">bed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但我却总瞥见你仍在床畔安眠</span></p><p begin="01:02.712" end="01:08.733" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:02.712" end="01:03.056">You</span> <span begin="01:03.056" end="01:03.457">didn't</span> <span begin="01:03.457" end="01:03.931">leave</span> <span begin="01:03.931" end="01:04.266">me</span> <span begin="01:04.266" end="01:05.474">much</span> <span begin="01:05.531" end="01:06.132">but</span> <span begin="01:06.348" end="01:06.565">the</span> <span begin="01:06.565" end="01:07.276">things</span> <span begin="01:07.276" end="01:07.837">you</span> <span begin="01:07.837" end="01:08.733">said</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你没有为我留下太多，唯有你的只言片语</span></p><p begin="01:11.276" end="01:16.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:11.276" end="01:11.589">They</span> <span begin="01:11.589" end="01:12.492">stayed,</span> <span begin="01:14.917" end="01:15.291">they</span> <span begin="01:15.291" end="01:16.390">stayed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">久久不散，声声在耳</span></p><p begin="01:23.481" end="01:26.577" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:23.481" end="01:23.747">I</span> <span begin="01:23.747" end="01:23.999">was</span> <span begin="01:23.999" end="01:24.422">driving</span> <span begin="01:24.422" end="01:24.666">through</span> <span begin="01:24.666" end="01:24.792">the</span> <span begin="01:24.792" end="01:25.408">streets</span> <span begin="01:25.408" end="01:25.686">one</span> <span begin="01:25.842" end="01:26.577">night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">某个夜晚，我驱车穿过街巷</span></p><p begin="01:27.194" end="01:30.531" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:27.194" end="01:27.371">At</span> <span begin="01:27.441" end="01:27.641">the</span> <span begin="01:27.641" end="01:28.179">corner</span> <span begin="01:28.179" end="01:28.408">with</span> <span begin="01:28.408" end="01:28.632">the</span> <span begin="01:28.632" end="01:29.085">bar</span> <span begin="01:29.085" end="01:29.557">you</span> <span begin="01:29.557" end="01:30.531">like</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">经过你喜欢的那间酒吧拐角</span></p><p begin="01:31.153" end="01:37.881" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:31.153" end="01:31.286">I</span> <span begin="01:31.286" end="01:31.613">thought</span> <span begin="01:31.613" end="01:31.735">I</span> <span begin="01:31.735" end="01:32.106">saw</span> <span begin="01:32.106" end="01:32.245">the</span> <span begin="01:32.245" end="01:32.683">car</span> <span begin="01:32.683" end="01:33.180">you</span> <span begin="01:33.180" end="01:33.649">drive</span> <span begin="01:33.649" end="01:33.822">but</span> <span begin="01:33.822" end="01:34.003">it</span> <span begin="01:34.003" end="01:35.294">wasn't</span> <span begin="01:36.015" end="01:37.881">green</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我以为看见了你的车，可它并不是那抹绿色</span></p><p begin="01:38.563" end="01:41.325" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:38.563" end="01:38.738">These</span> <span begin="01:38.738" end="01:39.493">neighborhoods</span> <span begin="01:39.493" end="01:39.695">all</span> <span begin="01:39.695" end="01:40.036">look</span> <span begin="01:40.036" end="01:40.302">the</span> <span begin="01:40.302" end="01:41.325">same</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这些街区 看起来都千篇一律</span></p><p begin="01:42.233" end="01:45.216" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:42.233" end="01:42.483">That's</span> <span begin="01:42.483" end="01:42.731">why</span> <span begin="01:42.731" end="01:42.905">you</span> <span begin="01:42.905" end="01:43.148">had</span> <span begin="01:43.148" end="01:43.415">to</span> <span begin="01:43.415" end="01:43.871">move</span> <span begin="01:43.871" end="01:45.216">away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这便是你执意离去的缘由</span></p><p begin="01:45.929" end="01:48.348" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:45.929" end="01:46.106">When</span> <span begin="01:46.106" end="01:46.577">people</span> <span begin="01:46.577" end="01:46.912">ask</span> <span begin="01:46.912" end="01:47.154">that's</span> <span begin="01:47.154" end="01:47.576">what</span> <span begin="01:47.576" end="01:47.830">I</span> <span begin="01:47.830" end="01:48.348">say</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">若有人问起，我便以此为由</span></p><p begin="01:48.420" end="01:52.636" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:48.420" end="01:48.602">But</span> <span begin="01:48.602" end="01:48.785">they</span> <span begin="01:48.785" end="01:49.871">know</span> <span begin="01:49.871" end="01:50.192">I'm</span> <span begin="01:50.757" end="01:52.636">lying</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可他们都知道，我不过是自己骗自己</span></p><p begin="01:54.424" end="01:59.955" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:54.424" end="01:54.703">I</span> <span begin="01:54.703" end="01:54.944">don't</span> <span begin="01:54.944" end="01:55.149">know</span> <span begin="01:55.149" end="01:55.616">who</span> <span begin="01:55.616" end="01:56.187">lives</span> <span begin="01:56.187" end="01:56.881">in</span> <span begin="01:57.244" end="01:58.170">these</span> <span begin="01:58.170" end="01:59.955">houses</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不知道如今是谁住进了这些房子</span></p><p begin="02:01.363" end="02:04.444" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="02:01.363" end="02:01.545">But</span> <span begin="02:01.545" end="02:01.699">you</span> <span begin="02:01.699" end="02:02.331">still</span> <span begin="02:02.331" end="02:02.635">live</span> <span begin="02:02.635" end="02:03.215">inside</span> <span begin="02:03.215" end="02:03.363">of</span> <span begin="02:03.363" end="02:03.480">my</span> <span begin="02:03.480" end="02:04.444">head</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可你依旧住在我的脑海深处</span></p><p begin="02:09.202" end="02:14.982" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="02:09.202" end="02:09.503">You</span> <span begin="02:09.503" end="02:09.979">didn't</span> <span begin="02:09.979" end="02:10.397">leave</span> <span begin="02:10.397" end="02:10.737">me</span> <span begin="02:10.882" end="02:12.032">much</span> <span begin="02:12.032" end="02:12.658">but</span> <span begin="02:12.658" end="02:12.813">the</span> <span begin="02:12.813" end="02:13.793">things</span> <span begin="02:13.793" end="02:14.331">you</span> <span begin="02:14.331" end="02:14.982">said</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你没给我留下什么，唯有那些说过的话</span></p><p begin="02:17.811" end="02:23.989" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="02:17.811" end="02:18.061">They</span> <span begin="02:18.061" end="02:19.414">stayed,</span> <span begin="02:21.457" end="02:21.745">they</span> <span begin="02:21.745" end="02:23.989">stayed</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="02:19.608" end="02:21.264"><span begin="02:19.608" end="02:19.938">(The</span> <span begin="02:19.938" end="02:21.264">stayed)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">声声在耳</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">挥之不去，长留心间</span></p><p begin="02:29.565" end="02:36.612" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="02:29.565" end="02:30.305">I</span> <span begin="02:30.305" end="02:31.192">still</span> <span begin="02:31.192" end="02:32.151">see</span> <span begin="02:32.151" end="02:32.788">you,</span> <span begin="02:33.213" end="02:33.832">you</span> <span begin="02:33.970" end="02:34.859">still</span> <span begin="02:34.859" end="02:35.972">see</span> <span begin="02:35.972" end="02:36.612">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我任能望见你，你也仍能望见我</span></p><p begin="02:37.624" end="02:42.070" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="02:37.624" end="02:37.819">But</span> <span begin="02:37.819" end="02:38.132">we</span> <span begin="02:38.132" end="02:38.611">don't</span> <span begin="02:38.611" end="02:39.369">see</span> <span begin="02:39.369" end="02:39.748">each</span> <span begin="02:39.748" end="02:40.557">other</span> <span begin="02:40.557" end="02:42.070">anymore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只是我们，再也不会真正相见</span></p><p begin="02:44.292" end="02:51.590" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="02:44.292" end="02:45.019">I</span> <span begin="02:45.019" end="02:46.143">still</span> <span begin="02:46.143" end="02:47.018">love</span> <span begin="02:47.018" end="02:47.539">you,</span> <span begin="02:47.923" end="02:48.711">you</span> <span begin="02:48.711" end="02:49.751">still</span> <span begin="02:49.751" end="02:50.714">love</span> <span begin="02:50.714" end="02:51.590">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我依然深爱着你，你也对我亦有余情</span></p><p begin="02:52.627" end="02:56.884" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="02:52.627" end="02:52.847">We</span> <span begin="02:52.847" end="02:53.512">can't</span> <span begin="02:53.512" end="02:53.852">love</span> <span begin="02:53.852" end="02:54.494">each</span> <span begin="02:54.494" end="02:55.058">other</span> <span begin="02:55.379" end="02:56.884">anymore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可我们再也不能彼此相爱</span></p><p begin="02:57.847" end="02:58.883" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="02:57.847" end="02:58.283">Can</span> <span begin="02:58.283" end="02:58.883">we?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不是吗?</span></p><p begin="03:30.389" end="03:35.906" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="03:30.389" end="03:30.713">I</span> <span begin="03:30.713" end="03:30.915">don't</span> <span begin="03:30.915" end="03:31.625">believe</span> <span begin="03:31.625" end="03:31.949">in</span> <span begin="03:31.949" end="03:34.016">haunted</span> <span begin="03:34.016" end="03:35.906">houses</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我从不相信世上真有鬼屋</span></p><p begin="03:37.354" end="03:40.750" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="03:37.354" end="03:37.535">But</span> <span begin="03:37.535" end="03:37.708">I</span> <span begin="03:37.708" end="03:38.228">still</span> <span begin="03:38.228" end="03:38.598">see</span> <span begin="03:38.598" end="03:38.847">you</span> <span begin="03:38.847" end="03:39.221">there</span> <span begin="03:39.221" end="03:39.374">on</span> <span begin="03:39.374" end="03:39.578">the</span> <span begin="03:39.578" end="03:40.750">bed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可我却依旧总瞥见你在床畔安眠</span></p><p begin="03:45.158" end="03:51.289" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="03:45.158" end="03:45.435">I</span> <span begin="03:45.435" end="03:45.710">wish</span> <span begin="03:45.710" end="03:45.897">I</span> <span begin="03:45.897" end="03:46.644">hadn't</span> <span begin="03:46.644" end="03:47.376">said</span> <span begin="03:48.005" end="03:48.626">all</span> <span begin="03:48.626" end="03:48.799">the</span> <span begin="03:48.799" end="03:49.769">things</span> <span begin="03:49.769" end="03:50.355">I</span> <span begin="03:50.355" end="03:51.289">said</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我多希望，当初未曾说出那些追悔莫及的话语</span></p></div></body></tt>